        {
          "id": 2707225113,
          "type": "DiscussionNote",
          "body": "After this change, All launchpad builder fail :\n\nhttps://launchpadlibrarian.net/813191732/buildlog_ubuntu-noble-amd64.wireshark_4.5.0-0~202508242126~ubuntu24.04.1_BUILDING.txt.gz\n\n```[gw3] linux -- Python 3.12.3 /usr/bin/python3\n\nself = <suite_extcaps.TestExtcaps object at 0x7619e30197c0>\ncheck_extcap_execution = <function check_extcap_execution.<locals>.check_extcap_execution_real at 0x7619e2806ca0>\n\n    def test_sshdig(self, check_extcap_execution):\n        ''' extcap interface tests for sshdig '''\n>       check_extcap_execution(\"sshdig\", stratoshark_extcap=True, always_present=False)\n\n../test/suite_extcaps.py:86: \n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ \n../test/suite_extcaps.py:43: in check_extcap_execution_real\n    subprocess.check_call([cmd_extcap(extcap_name, stratoshark_extcap), '--help'], cwd=program_path, env=base_env)\n../test/fixtures_ws.py:156: in extcap_name\n    return program(os.path.join('extcap/stratoshark', name))\n_ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ _ \n\nname = 'extcap/stratoshark/sshdig'\n\n    def resolver(name):\n        path = os.path.abspath(os.path.join(program_path, name + dotexe))\n        if not os.access(path, os.X_OK):\n            if skip_if_missing == ['all'] or name in skip_if_missing:\n                pytest.skip('Program %s is not available' % (name,))\n>           raise AssertionError('Program %s is not available' % (name,))\nE           AssertionError: Program extcap/stratoshark/sshdig is not available\n```",
          "author": {
